@format 1
@id ui-event.pexport-preset-panel-up
@title Preset panel - mouse left button up
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@event-ref cs|PPanels/PExportSummary.cs|PExport|pPresetRowPanel|MouseLeftButtonUp|1
@entry input
@summary Finish a captured preset click or drag before releasing stable panel capture.
@tag mouse left button up
@tag PExport
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] UI event <input>
- Receive mouse release from the captured preset panel @ owner.PExportUpHandle
> route

[route] Finish interaction <process>
- Restore source opacity and remove the shared ghost @ owner.PExportDragClear
- Release panel capture after drag state has been cleared @ owner.PExportUpHandle
- Select the preset only when the pointer never crossed the drag threshold @ owner.PExportUpHandle
> output

[output] Preset interaction complete <output>
= The drag visual is gone and a click selects while a drag preserves the reordered list.
! Code binding: cs|PPanels/PExportSummary.cs|PExport|pPresetRowPanel|MouseLeftButtonUp|1
